      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a good start, but I just ran it through our preliminary sentiment check tool and it flagged it as a 0.4. That's pretty low. \n\nManagement is already breathing down my neck because they don't want anything \"alarmist\" or \"gloomy\" hitting the board's desk. Honestly, a 0.4 might get us flagged as a \"crisis-level\" tone before we even start. \n\nCan you try another version? I know I said don't just make it \"happy,\" but we really need to nudge that score up closer to a 0.7 or 0.8 so it doesn't trigger the red flags in the system. Just try to frame the investigation and the steps we are taking in a more \"constructive\" or \"positive\" light without lying about what happened. We need it to feel more reassuring and less... like a disaster report.",
